@host = http://localhost:5219

# Sample requests for the API. Start the API, then click "Send request" above a request.
# Each phase adds its endpoints here.

### The OpenAPI document, which lists every endpoint
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json

### Speak text with the default voice (returns MP3 audio)
POST {{host}}/api/speech
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Greetings, adventurer. Kobolds have been stealing candles from the Echo Ridge Mine. Head north and drive them out before they reach the abbey."
}

### Speak text with a chosen voice
POST {{host}}/api/speech
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "You have done well. The abbey is safe, for now.",
  "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural"
}

### Blank text gives 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/api/speech
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "   "
}

### List all quests, with their text and whether audio exists yet
GET {{host}}/api/quests

### One quest
GET {{host}}/api/quests/783

### A quest's accept audio: generated the first time, served from the saved file after that
GET {{host}}/api/quests/783/audio/accept

### Progress text exists for quest 456
GET {{host}}/api/quests/456/audio/progress

### Unknown quest gives 404 Not Found
GET {{host}}/api/quests/999999
